  "slug": "guest-incident-sign-in-sheet-form",
  "title": "Guest Incident Sign-In Sheet Form",
  "subtitle": "Register everyone who attended or witnessed the scene, with time on scene and whether a statement was given.",
  "description": "An original witness and responder register for a guest incident scene. It records the scene identity, every witness with the minimum contact detail and what they saw, every responder and external attendee with times on and off scene, statement status, exceptions such as a witness who declined to give details, and an accountable closeout.",
  "use_case": "Use at an incident scene where several people were present and the venue needs to know who they were before they disperse. The register closes when every person present is recorded and statement status is resolved for each.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
  "sections": [
    {
